WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:03.099
(playful music)

00:00:07.493 --> 00:00:08.709
- Hi, my name is Jim Beagle,

00:00:08.709 --> 00:00:10.973
I'm one of the owners at
Grapery along with Jack Pandol.

00:00:10.973 --> 00:00:13.721
And today we're in a
cotton candy vineyard.

00:00:13.721 --> 00:00:15.271
We're involved in a breeding program

00:00:15.271 --> 00:00:16.869
where we breed new grape varieties.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.427
It's all natural, non-GMO

00:00:18.427 --> 00:00:20.088
and we've been able to come up with

00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:22.841
some really great flavors in grapes.

00:00:22.841 --> 00:00:25.010
One of the first ones is cotton candy

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.867
but we have many more to come.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:28.411
You know, just to see
people eating healthy

00:00:28.411 --> 00:00:32.017
and enjoying eating healthy,
it really motivates us.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.445
- Cotton candy grapes?

00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:37.920
Never heard of such a thing.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.143
- I don't know how a grape
can taste like cotton candy.

00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:42.818
- The fact that you're
telling me this grape

00:00:42.818 --> 00:00:45.210
is gonna taste like candy, creeps me out.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.626
- They smell like normal grapes.

00:00:46.626 --> 00:00:47.904
- Here we go, woo!

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:51.837
- Oh, that's so weird!

00:00:51.837 --> 00:00:54.022
- Whoa, that tastes like cotton candy.

00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:56.006
- Oh my God. Oh my goodness

00:00:56.006 --> 00:00:56.901
I can taste it.

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:57.981
- I can taste the cotton candy.

00:00:57.981 --> 00:00:59.129
- Wow
- For sure.

00:00:59.129 --> 00:01:00.820
- I feel like I'm at the ballpark

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:01.986
or the old carnival.

00:01:01.986 --> 00:01:03.367
- If I burped in someone's face right now

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:05.283
they'd be like, "Dude, you've
been eating cotton candy.".

00:01:05.283 --> 00:01:07.245
- It's like a flavor
tripping type of thing.

00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:08.743
You're expecting one thing,

00:01:08.743 --> 00:01:11.168
but then you get something
that's slightly different.

00:01:11.168 --> 00:01:12.387
- Now I don't know if I know what

00:01:12.387 --> 00:01:13.804
cotton candy tastes like anymore.

00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:15.163
- It's like what you
wish when you were a kid,

00:01:15.163 --> 00:01:19.806
like, "I wish this salad in my
mouth tasted like a pizza.".

00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:21.443
- I think these'll be great for kids

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:22.987
cuz it'll encourage them to eat fruit

00:01:22.987 --> 00:01:25.100
because it's fruit that tastes like candy.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.202
- Society teaches the kids that

00:01:27.202 --> 00:01:28.466
vegetables and fruit is gross,

00:01:28.466 --> 00:01:29.721
but like it tastes so good.

00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:31.602
- Fruits and vegetables are delicious.

00:01:31.602 --> 00:01:34.103
- If you're gonna breed candy into fruit,

00:01:34.103 --> 00:01:35.646
I'm in love with you.

00:01:36.118 --> 00:01:37.912
(playful music)

00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:45.347
- I don't think I would want my wine

00:01:45.347 --> 00:01:46.578
to taste like cotton candy though.

00:01:46.578 --> 00:01:47.548
- Certainly not.

